Possible SPOILER

No, spellbooks are specialy taken care off when assigning quantity to the
object wished for (let != SPBOOK_SYM).

And don't wish for to many, to code goes: cnt < rnd(6), so a count
of tree (3) is 50% chance to get more than one (1).

For arrows, bolts, darts, shurikens and rocks it is: cnt <= 20.

